<tr>
  <td align="left">
    <p style="margin-bottom: 12px">Hi {{candidateName}},</p>
    <p>Congratulations! <strong>{{companyName}}</strong> was impressed with your application for the <strong>{{jobTitle}}</strong> position.</p>
    <p>They would like to invite you to the next stage of the hiring process:</p>
    <p style="font-weight: 700; margin: 24px 0 12px 0;"><strong>Interview Details:</strong></p>
    <ul style="margin: 12px 0; padding-left: 28px;">
      <li style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px;"><strong>Interview Type:</strong> {{interviewType}}</li>
      <li style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px;"><strong>Date & Time:</strong> {{interviewDateTime}}</li>
      <li style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px;"><strong>Notes:</strong> {{{notes}}}</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="font-weight: 700; margin: 24px 0 12px 0;"><strong>Next Steps:</strong></p>
    <ol style="margin: 12px 0; padding-left: 28px;">
      <li style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px;">Review the job description and company profile</li>
      <li style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 12px;">Prepare your questions for the interview</li>
    </ol>

  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td align="center" style="padding: 30px 0;">
    <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <a href="{{meetingLink}}" target="_blank" class="button">Join Meeting</a>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td align="left">
    <p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0;">Good luck! We're rooting for you.</p>
  </td>
</tr>
 
